{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53735","headline":"咏山魈 · 施肩吾","name":"咏山魈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山魈本是伍家奴，何事今爲圣者呼？小鬼不须乖去就，国家才子号肩吾。\n（见何光远《监诫录》卷八）（《监戒录》云：肩吾「及第後，游南楚。\n楚多山魈爲患，俗号圣者。\n是时亦来馆谷，搅扰施君，施君当风一咏，於是屏迹。\n诗曰〖略〗」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}